2. Brand mark — build/brand-mark-black-hole.png
-----------------------------------------------

The ink black hole the sidebar draws, 1254x1254, was supplied for this theme and
is redistributed here under the MIT licence in LICENSE section 1. It is not
character artwork, it is not derived from anyone else's picture, and it names no
third party.


3. No other third-party material
--------------------------------

This package ships no wallpaper, no character illustration and no other external
image. `build/wallpapers.json` is tracked and empty: a build from it emits
`--cp-pick-light: none; --cp-pick-dark: none;` and paints no background. Nothing
is fetched from a third-party host at paint time.
